@startuml
title UML - Immutable Finance observation and independent liquidity
actor "Finance adjuster" as user
participant "Workforce / BFF" as api
participant "Finance reports" as finance
participant "Core FinanceRecords" as core
database "Core store" as cs
database "Finance store" as fs
participant "Synthetic liquidity" as provider
participant "Controls / worker" as controls
user -> api : save UTC period + stable request UUID
api -> finance : verified workforce, Origin and CSRF
finance -> controls : current Finance role / queue
finance -> fs : lookup actor/client/key
alt same request already saved
 fs --> finance : original immutable artifact
 finance --> api : original ID / controls / frozen membership
else new observation
 finance -> core : bounded period snapshot (read-only port)
 core -> cs : REPEATABLE READ, READ ONLY
 cs --> core : one snapshot: account stocks, commitments, journals and legs
 core --> finance : immutable sources + Core as-of
 finance -> fs : separate consistent GL / chart / receipt snapshot
 fs --> finance : original export documents / proofs + Finance as-of
note over finance,fs
Both database read transactions close before HTTP.
The source clocks remain explicit; no global atomicity is claimed.
end note
 finance -> provider : independently signed currency/scope + request nonce
 provider --> finance : signed original cash evidence or missing / invalid / stale
 finance -> finance : exact controls and source / date / mapping / receipt checks
 finance -> finance : cash unavailable unless fresh; expected funds remain separate
 finance -> fs : under request lock: immutable summary / members / proofs / issues / audit
 finance -> controls : stable owned observation cases
 controls -> fs : recover lost case assignment acknowledgments in bounded pages
 finance --> api : snapshot URL / controls / digests / safe evidence
end
user -> api : reopen snapshot; page frozen source lineage
api -> finance : current authority
finance -> fs : original artifact, membership, captured proof archives
finance -> finance : reconstruct digests; verify archived integrity\nderive current freshness without rewriting artifact
finance --> user : original captured report + separate current evidence status
note over finance,core
Reporting has no reserve, release or booking command.
Later observations never rewrite earlier reports.
end note
@enduml
